{"jsonrpc":"2.0","id":1,"result":{"_meta":{"dev.moedex/server":{"version":"dev+unknown"},"dev.moedex/snapshot":{"cacheable":true,"corpus_fingerprint":"c08c410b6f87d0fb57705d2e42bc232af92a29cc4c27aaf8a3a1a8b926b94434","blob_shas":["16d40af749971f67edae3e8ba485b24f5bbaa5e2","47da061667feacc754e973305717e82098e67136","8b48b2f063e02e4eae61bac29ed1fef7c7424b63","b0dcb76c7a4bb7b4dd888175c0ed754e63fbaefb","b49959f409c022164e94367f5f565a0cd07a3137"]}},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"5 context block(s), ~1263 tokens\n\n--- src/Sample.Api/Controllers/RegistrationController.cs:1-46 (score 0.0492) ---\nnamespace Sample.Api.Controllers;\n\nusing Components;\nusing Microsoft.AspNetCore.Mvc;\n\n\n[ApiController]\n[Route(\"[controller]\")]\npublic class RegistrationController :\n    ControllerBase\n{\n    readonly IRegistrationService _registrationService;\n\n    public RegistrationController(IRegistrationService registrationService)\n    {\n        _registrationService = registrationService;\n    }\n\n    [HttpPost]\n    public async Task\u003cIActionResult\u003e Submit([FromBody] RegistrationModel model)\n    {\n        if (!ModelState.IsValid)\n            return BadRequest(ModelState);\n\n        try\n        {\n            var registration = await _registrationService.SubmitRegistration(model.EventId, model.MemberId, model.Payment);\n\n            return Ok(new\n            {\n                registration.RegistrationId,\n                registration.RegistrationDate,\n                registration.MemberId,\n                registration.EventId,\n            });\n        }\n        catch (DuplicateRegistrationException)\n        {\n            return Conflict(new\n            {\n                model.MemberId,\n                model.EventId,\n            });\n        }\n    }\n}\n\n--- README.md:2-8 (score 0.0161) ---\n\nThis sample shows how to configure and use MassTransit's new transactional outbox, including:\n\n- An API controller that uses a domain registration service to register a member for an event. The controller has no knowledge of MassTransit, and the registration service uses `IPublishEndpoint` to publish a domain event which is written to the transactional outbox.\n- Adds the transactional outbox delivery service as a hosted service, which delivers outbox message to the transport.\n- A separate service that consumes the domain event by itself, and also includes a saga state machine which uses the transactional outbox (and inbox, for idempotent message delivery).\n\n\n--- src/Sample.Components/RegistrationService.cs:9-54 (score 0.0159) ---\npublic class RegistrationService :\n    IRegistrationService\n{\n    readonly RegistrationDbContext _dbContext;\n    readonly IPublishEndpoint _publishEndpoint;\n\n    public RegistrationService(RegistrationDbContext dbContext, IPublishEndpoint publishEndpoint)\n    {\n        _dbContext = dbContext;\n        _publishEndpoint = publishEndpoint;\n    }\n\n    public async Task\u003cRegistration\u003e SubmitRegistration(string eventId, string memberId, decimal payment)\n    {\n        var registration = new Registration\n        {\n            RegistrationId = NewId.NextGuid(),\n            RegistrationDate = DateTime.UtcNow,\n            MemberId = memberId,\n            EventId = eventId,\n            Payment = payment\n        };\n\n        await _dbContext.Set\u003cRegistration\u003e().AddAsync(registration);\n\n        await _publishEndpoint.Publish(new RegistrationSubmitted\n        {\n            RegistrationId = registration.RegistrationId,\n            RegistrationDate = registration.RegistrationDate,\n            MemberId = registration.MemberId,\n            EventId = registration.EventId,\n            Payment = payment\n        });\n\n        try\n        {\n            await _dbContext.SaveChangesAsync();\n        }\n        catch (DbUpdateException exception) when (exception.InnerException is PostgresException { SqlState: PostgresErrorCodes.UniqueViolation })\n        {\n            throw new DuplicateRegistrationException(\"Duplicate registration\", exception);\n        }\n\n        return registration;\n    }\n}\n\n--- src/Sample.Components/RegistrationDbContext.cs:10-53 (score 0.0156) ---\npublic class RegistrationDbContext :\n    SagaDbContext\n{\n    public RegistrationDbContext(DbContextOptions\u003cRegistrationDbContext\u003e options)\n        : base(options)\n    {\n    }\n\n    protected override IEnumerable\u003cISagaClassMap\u003e Configurations\n    {\n        get { yield return new RegistrationStateMap(); }\n    }\n\n    protected override void OnModelCreating(ModelBuilder modelBuilder)\n    {\n        base.OnModelCreating(modelBuilder);\n\n        MapRegistration(modelBuilder);\n\n        modelBuilder.AddInboxStateEntity();\n        modelBuilder.AddOutboxMessageEntity();\n        modelBuilder.AddOutboxStateEntity();\n    }\n\n    static void MapRegistration(ModelBuilder modelBuilder)\n    {\n        EntityTypeBuilder\u003cRegistration\u003e registration = modelBuilder.Entity\u003cRegistration\u003e();\n\n        registration.Property(x =\u003e x.Id);\n        registration.HasKey(x =\u003e x.Id);\n\n        registration.Property(x =\u003e x.RegistrationId);\n        registration.Property(x =\u003e x.RegistrationDate);\n        registration.Property(x =\u003e x.MemberId).HasMaxLength(64);\n        registration.Property(x =\u003e x.EventId).HasMaxLength(64);\n        registration.Property(x =\u003e x.Payment);\n\n        registration.HasIndex(x =\u003e new\n        {\n            x.MemberId,\n            x.EventId\n        }).IsUnique();\n    }\n}\n\n--- src/Sample.Components/Services/RegistrationValidationService.cs:7-21 (score 0.0154) ---\npublic class RegistrationValidationService :\n    IRegistrationValidationService\n{\n    readonly IPublishEndpoint _publishEndpoint;\n\n    public RegistrationValidationService(IPublishEndpoint publishEndpoint)\n    {\n        _publishEndpoint = publishEndpoint;\n    }\n\n    public async Task ValidateRegistration(string eventId, string memberId, Guid registrationId)\n    {\n        await _publishEndpoint.Publish(new RegistrationValidated { RegistrationId = registrationId });\n    }\n}\n"}],"structuredContent":{"summary":{"scope":{"repo":"Sample-Outbox"},"blocks":5,"token_estimate":1263,"truncated":false,"clipped":false},"blocks":[{"blob":7,"blob_sha":"8b48b2f063e02e4eae61bac29ed1fef7c7424b63","repo":"Sample-Outbox","path_with_namespace":"Sample-Outbox","rel_path":"src/Sample.Api/Controllers/RegistrationController.cs","abs_path":"/Users/zakkeown/Code/moedex/.local/application-impact/run-wrapper-v1/corpus/Sample-Outbox/src/Sample.Api/Controllers/RegistrationController.cs","start_line":1,"end_line":46,"score":0.04918032786885246,"lexical":10.419370764263455,"dense":0,"text":"namespace Sample.Api.Controllers;\n\nusing Components;\nusing Microsoft.AspNetCore.Mvc;\n\n\n[ApiController]\n[Route(\"[controller]\")]\npublic class RegistrationController :\n    ControllerBase\n{\n    readonly IRegistrationService _registrationService;\n\n    public RegistrationController(IRegistrationService registrationService)\n    {\n        _registrationService = registrationService;\n    }\n\n    [HttpPost]\n    public async Task\u003cIActionResult\u003e Submit([FromBody] RegistrationModel model)\n    {\n        if (!ModelState.IsValid)\n            return BadRequest(ModelState);\n\n        try\n        {\n            var registration = await _registrationService.SubmitRegistration(model.EventId, model.MemberId, model.Payment);\n\n            return Ok(new\n            {\n                registration.RegistrationId,\n                registration.RegistrationDate,\n                registration.MemberId,\n                registration.EventId,\n            });\n        }\n        catch (DuplicateRegistrationException)\n        {\n            return Conflict(new\n            {\n                model.MemberId,\n                model.EventId,\n            });\n        }\n    }\n}\n","clipped":false},{"blob":1,"blob_sha":"b49959f409c022164e94367f5f565a0cd07a3137","repo":"Sample-Outbox","path_with_namespace":"Sample-Outbox","rel_path":"README.md","abs_path":"/Users/zakkeown/Code/moedex/.local/application-impact/run-wrapper-v1/corpus/Sample-Outbox/README.md","start_line":2,"end_line":8,"score":0.016129032258064516,"lexical":4.342845073795045,"dense":0,"text":"\nThis sample shows how to configure and use MassTransit's new transactional outbox, including:\n\n- An API controller that uses a domain registration service to register a member for an event. The controller has no knowledge of MassTransit, and the registration service uses `IPublishEndpoint` to publish a domain event which is written to the transactional outbox.\n- Adds the transactional outbox delivery service as a hosted service, which delivers outbox message to the transport.\n- A separate service that consumes the domain event by itself, and also includes a saga state machine which uses the transactional outbox (and inbox, for idempotent message delivery).\n\n","clipped":false},{"blob":28,"blob_sha":"16d40af749971f67edae3e8ba485b24f5bbaa5e2","repo":"Sample-Outbox","path_with_namespace":"Sample-Outbox","rel_path":"src/Sample.Components/RegistrationService.cs","abs_path":"/Users/zakkeown/Code/moedex/.local/application-impact/run-wrapper-v1/corpus/Sample-Outbox/src/Sample.Components/RegistrationService.cs","start_line":9,"end_line":54,"score":0.015873015873015872,"lexical":0.9743371937025301,"dense":0,"text":"public class RegistrationService :\n    IRegistrationService\n{\n    readonly RegistrationDbContext _dbContext;\n    readonly IPublishEndpoint _publishEndpoint;\n\n    public RegistrationService(RegistrationDbContext dbContext, IPublishEndpoint publishEndpoint)\n    {\n        _dbContext = dbContext;\n        _publishEndpoint = publishEndpoint;\n    }\n\n    public async Task\u003cRegistration\u003e SubmitRegistration(string eventId, string memberId, decimal payment)\n    {\n        var registration = new Registration\n        {\n            RegistrationId = NewId.NextGuid(),\n            RegistrationDate = DateTime.UtcNow,\n            MemberId = memberId,\n            EventId = eventId,\n            Payment = payment\n        };\n\n        await _dbContext.Set\u003cRegistration\u003e().AddAsync(registration);\n\n        await _publishEndpoint.Publish(new RegistrationSubmitted\n        {\n            RegistrationId = registration.RegistrationId,\n            RegistrationDate = registration.RegistrationDate,\n            MemberId = registration.MemberId,\n            EventId = registration.EventId,\n            Payment = payment\n        });\n\n        try\n        {\n            await _dbContext.SaveChangesAsync();\n        }\n        catch (DbUpdateException exception) when (exception.InnerException is PostgresException { SqlState: PostgresErrorCodes.UniqueViolation })\n        {\n            throw new DuplicateRegistrationException(\"Duplicate registration\", exception);\n        }\n\n        return registration;\n    }\n}\n","clipped":false},{"blob":27,"blob_sha":"b0dcb76c7a4bb7b4dd888175c0ed754e63fbaefb","repo":"Sample-Outbox","path_with_namespace":"Sample-Outbox","rel_path":"src/Sample.Components/RegistrationDbContext.cs","abs_path":"/Users/zakkeown/Code/moedex/.local/application-impact/run-wrapper-v1/corpus/Sample-Outbox/src/Sample.Components/RegistrationDbContext.cs","start_line":10,"end_line":53,"score":0.015625,"lexical":0.9437318102129851,"dense":0,"text":"public class RegistrationDbContext :\n    SagaDbContext\n{\n    public RegistrationDbContext(DbContextOptions\u003cRegistrationDbContext\u003e options)\n        : base(options)\n    {\n    }\n\n    protected override IEnumerable\u003cISagaClassMap\u003e Configurations\n    {\n        get { yield return new RegistrationStateMap(); }\n    }\n\n    protected override void OnModelCreating(ModelBuilder modelBuilder)\n    {\n        base.OnModelCreating(modelBuilder);\n\n        MapRegistration(modelBuilder);\n\n        modelBuilder.AddInboxStateEntity();\n        modelBuilder.AddOutboxMessageEntity();\n        modelBuilder.AddOutboxStateEntity();\n    }\n\n    static void MapRegistration(ModelBuilder modelBuilder)\n    {\n        EntityTypeBuilder\u003cRegistration\u003e registration = modelBuilder.Entity\u003cRegistration\u003e();\n\n        registration.Property(x =\u003e x.Id);\n        registration.HasKey(x =\u003e x.Id);\n\n        registration.Property(x =\u003e x.RegistrationId);\n        registration.Property(x =\u003e x.RegistrationDate);\n        registration.Property(x =\u003e x.MemberId).HasMaxLength(64);\n        registration.Property(x =\u003e x.EventId).HasMaxLength(64);\n        registration.Property(x =\u003e x.Payment);\n\n        registration.HasIndex(x =\u003e new\n        {\n            x.MemberId,\n            x.EventId\n        }).IsUnique();\n    }\n}\n","clipped":false},{"blob":31,"blob_sha":"47da061667feacc754e973305717e82098e67136","repo":"Sample-Outbox","path_with_namespace":"Sample-Outbox","rel_path":"src/Sample.Components/Services/RegistrationValidationService.cs","abs_path":"/Users/zakkeown/Code/moedex/.local/application-impact/run-wrapper-v1/corpus/Sample-Outbox/src/Sample.Components/Services/RegistrationValidationService.cs","start_line":7,"end_line":21,"score":0.015384615384615385,"lexical":0.9405482176030182,"dense":0,"text":"public class RegistrationValidationService :\n    IRegistrationValidationService\n{\n    readonly IPublishEndpoint _publishEndpoint;\n\n    public RegistrationValidationService(IPublishEndpoint publishEndpoint)\n    {\n        _publishEndpoint = publishEndpoint;\n    }\n\n    public async Task ValidateRegistration(string eventId, string memberId, Guid registrationId)\n    {\n        await _publishEndpoint.Publish(new RegistrationValidated { RegistrationId = registrationId });\n    }\n}\n","clipped":false}]}}}